fixtures/zeiss_sem/test_tiff_Zeiss_SEM_512pix.tif are members of
tiff_FEI_Helios.zip and tiff_Zeiss_SEM.zip, and
fixtures/imagej/test_loading_image_saved_with_imageJ.tif is a file, of the
test data of RosettaSciIO (https://github.com/hyperspy/rosettasciio), copied
unchanged from its tag v0.15.0, rsciio/tests/data/tiff/. RosettaSciIO is
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later
(GPL-3.0-or-later).

